msgid "MTK NPU SQM QoS"
msgstr "MTK NPU 硬件 SQM QoS"

msgid "MediaTek NPU Hardware SQM QoS"
msgstr "MediaTek NPU 硬件 SQM 智能流控"

msgid "Configure NETSYS v3 QDMA 16-queue fair/priority hardware SQM scheduling and hybrid CAKE uplink shaping for 5G EXT interfaces."
msgstr "配置 MT7987/MT7988 NETSYS v3 QDMA 16 队列公平/优先硬件 SQM 调度，以及 5G EXT 蜂窝接口的混合 CAKE 上行整形。"

